{"suttaId":"thi-ap15","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[7119,7192],"vripara":"61"},"segments":{"thi-ap15:0.3":"Pañcadīpadāyikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap15:1.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā, cārikī [cārikā (sī. syā.)] āsahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap15:1.3":"Ārāmena ca ārāmaṃ [ārāmena vihārena (syā. pī.)], carāmi kusalatthikā.","thi-ap15:2.1":"“Kāḷapakkhamhi divase, addasaṃ bodhimuttamaṃ;","thi-ap15:2.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, bodhimūle nisīdahaṃ.","thi-ap15:3.1":"“Garucittaṃ upaṭṭhetvā, sire katvāna añjaliṃ;","thi-ap15:3.3":"Somanassaṃ pavedetvā, evaṃ cintesi tāvade.","thi-ap15:4.1":"“‘Yadi buddho amitaguṇo, asamappaṭipuggalo;","thi-ap15:4.3":"Dassetu pāṭihīraṃ me, bodhi obhāsatu ayaṃ’.","thi-ap15:5.1":"“Saha āvajjite mayhaṃ, bodhi pajjali tāvade;","thi-ap15:5.3":"Sabbasoṇṇamayā āsi, disā sabbā virocati.","thi-ap15:6.1":"“Sattarattindivaṃ tattha, bodhimūle nisīdahaṃ;","thi-ap15:6.3":"Sattame divase patte, dīpapūjaṃ akāsahaṃ.","thi-ap15:7.1":"“Āsanaṃ parivāretvā, pañca dīpāni pajjaluṃ;","thi-ap15:7.3":"Yāva udeti sūriyo, dīpā me pajjaluṃ tadā.","thi-ap15:8.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap15:8.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap15:9.1":"“Tattha me sukataṃ byamhaṃ, pañcadīpāti vuccati;","thi-ap15:9.3":"Saṭṭhiyojanamubbedhaṃ, tiṃsayojanavitthataṃ.","thi-ap15:10.1":"“Asaṅkhiyāni dīpāni, parivāre jaliṃsu me;","thi-ap15:10.3":"Yāvatā devabhavanaṃ, dīpālokena jotati.","thi-ap15:11.1":"“Parammukhā [pubbamukhā (syā.)] nisīditvā, yadi icchāmi passituṃ;","thi-ap15:11.3":"Uddhaṃ adho ca tiriyaṃ, sabbaṃ passāmi cakkhunā.","thi-ap15:12.1":"“Yāvatā abhikaṅkhāmi, daṭṭhuṃ sugataduggate [sukatadukkaṭe (pī.)];","thi-ap15:12.3":"Tattha āvaraṇaṃ natthi, rukkhesu pabbatesu vā.","thi-ap15:13.1":"“Asīti devarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap15:13.3":"Satānaṃ cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap15:14.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","thi-ap15:14.3":"Dīpasatasahassāni, parivāre jalanti me.","thi-ap15:15.1":"“Devalokā cavitvāna, uppajjiṃ mātukucchiyaṃ;","thi-ap15:15.3":"Mātukucchigatā santī, akkhi me na nimīlati.","thi-ap15:16.1":"“Dīpasatasahassāni, puññakammasamaṅgitā;","thi-ap15:16.3":"Jalanti sūtikāgehe, pañcadīpānidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap15:17.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, mānasaṃ vinivattayiṃ;","thi-ap15:17.3":"Ajarāmataṃ sītibhāvaṃ, nibbānaṃ phassayiṃ ahaṃ.","thi-ap15:18.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassāhaṃ, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","thi-ap15:18.3":"Upasampādayī buddho, guṇamaññāya gotamo.","thi-ap15:19.1":"“Maṇḍape rukkhamūle vā, suññāgāre vasantiyā;","thi-ap15:19.3":"Sadā pajjalate dīpaṃ, pañcadīpānidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap15:20.1":"“Dibbacakkhu visuddhaṃ me, samādhikusalā ahaṃ;","thi-ap15:20.3":"Abhiññāpāramippattā, pañcadīpānidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap15:21.1":"“Sabbavositavosānā, katakiccā anāsavā;","thi-ap15:21.3":"Pañcadīpā mahāvīra, pāde vandāmi cakkhuma.","thi-ap15:22.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dīpamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap15:22.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pañcadīpānidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap15:23.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap15:24.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap15:25.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap15:26.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ pañcadīpadāyikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap15:27.1":"Pañcadīpadāyikātheriyāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
